---@field include_media? boolean Set to false to judge text only.
---@field reasoning_level? posthog.evaluations.EvaluationEvaluationConfigCase0ReasoningLevel|distilled.Null How much the judge model reasons before it answers. Only Anthropic and OpenAI reasoning models with the 'llm' judge method support it. Omit to keep the saved level; null uses the model's default.

---Judge method. Omit to keep the saved method; null restores automatic routing.
